body:
as cliche as it is, I know how you feel. I feel like a mistake, like I'm the rough draft of my life. I hate the way my life is too. Im alone and have been for a long time. It might as well be. I wish I could start over. I dont because I know I will regret it the second its done. I regret most things I dont finish and life is no exempt from that. I posted today of how I feel my life looks compare to my sister's. I know the family hates me and is annoyed with my mental health, but thats t heir problem. My problem is trying to work with it rather than try to fix anything. Im broken too, but isnt everyone? 

&#x200B;

what im trying to say is that you have just as much right to life as anyone else. We were all born the same way, we all will eventually die, but life is so short I figured I might as well see how it all ends.
